  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You create an illusory warping of space that fills a 60-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point within range. For each creature you can see in the Sphere, you can choose one of the following effects.</p><p><strong>Dizzying Elongation.</strong> The creature makes an Intelligence saving throw. On a failure, it takes 2d10 Psychic damage, and the Sphere is &amp;Reference[difficultterrain apply=false]{Difficult Terrain} for it until the end of its turn.</p><p><strong>Shortened Space.</strong> The creature’s Speed increases by 20 feet until the end of its next turn.</p><p>Until the spell ends, whenever a creature enters the Sphere or ends its turn there, you can give it one of these effects. A creature can be affected by this spell only once per turn.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
